A||N||5||87ECO5||Fiero Apparel and Novelties||||1||
Z||000000||87ECO5||02-07-2001||09:51 AM||||I'd like to compile a list of Fiero novelty items like shirts, hats, glassware, etc. - anything that we, as owners, can wear or carry around to show our love for our car(s).<P><B>Apparel</B><P> <A HREF="http://FieroStore.com" TARGET=_blank>FieroStore.com</A>  - under the "apparel & novelty" section of the online catalog.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/biz/fierosails/" TARGET=_blank>www.angelfire.com/biz/fierosails/</A>  - under the "Fiero shirts" section.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com/" TARGET=_blank>www.rodneydickman.com/</A>  - under "Fiero Accessories Online Shopping" then "Apparel" tab.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroowners.com/store.htm" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroowners.com/store.htm</A>  - scroll down to "Fiero Clothing".<P><B>Glassware</B><P> <A HREF="http://FieroStore.com" TARGET=_blank>FieroStore.com</A>  - under the "apparel & novelty" section of the online catalog.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.ashleysmark.com/fiero_stuff.htm" TARGET=_blank>www.ashleysmark.com/fiero_stuff.htm</A>  - glasses and coffee mugs.<P><B>Novelties</B><P> <A HREF="http://www.fieroowners.com/store.htm" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroowners.com/store.htm</A>  - scroll down to "Fiero Specialties".<P>OK, folks.  Help me do this.  Post information here ...<p>[This message has been edited by 87ECO5 (edited 02-07-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroJoe||02-07-2001||10:24 AM||||Rodney Dickman has some stuff.  Hat pins, earrings, necklaces, shirts, even hand towels!<BR> <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com" TARGET=_blank>www.rodneydickman.com</A> <P>------------------<BR>FieroJoe<BR>c311t@yahoo.com<BR>AIM: Fiero87311, Snowboarder0311<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
